{"id":"vod_sn_36831","vodId":"36831","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"水星领航员第一季","name_cn":"水星领航员第一季","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/087a67b7c9ff15a709ff619de375d403.jpg"},"summary":"由人类改造而成的“水之星球”AQUA上，有一座著名的观光城市“新威尼斯”。15岁的水无灯里（叶月绘理乃 配音）从地球来到新威尼斯，憧憬着成为一名帅气的领航员，“领航员”的主要工作是划着凤尾舟载着游客领略水城的美景。她在一所叫亚利亚的领航公司中担任领航员工作，她先后结识了蓝华、爱丽丝等好友，还遇上被称为“三大水精灵”之一的艾丽西亚前辈。　　身为“半熟手”的灯里，尽管还不能熟练地出航招待客人，但她每一天都为梦想而努力着。在水之城新威尼斯上，乐天派的灯里和她的朋友们经历着各种各样的新鲜事，从这些与地球全然不同的际遇中，灯里渐渐地意识到要成为一名出色的领航员意味着什么。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:46:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/iPg3bGtaH31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/rm1Nxhrbb91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yyiWPmQNum1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Ng91HXYGn11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s2WtAHHzw91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/7h4eAqf6rn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/wXAcucKgip1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/WqwvBHDKwP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EEMCN9PvWQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/pyUwkHQYp41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/m1BZSqe6et1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/mWWGWZpz3H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/qPzhVwR7id1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:18.268Z"}